Port message catalogs
---------------------
The message catalogs in `locales/<tag>/lomboklocale.json` contain the
user-facing messages of this library itself, written for this project
(English source of truth; reviewed Indonesian; machine-translated drafts for
the other languages, see `locales/STATUS.md`). They are not CLDR data.

